,"pronunciation":["옫"]},{"id":"ba47d0c0fad38891","term":"늘어나다","zh":"增，涨，扩大","audio":"/audio/ba47d0c0fad388914dca.mp3","entryId":"62833","definition":"体积、数量或程度比原来渐渐变大或变多。","pronunciation":["느러나다"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"fcdd70c819dd4279","term":"잡아끌다","zh":"拽，拖，拉拽","audio":"/audio/fcdd70c819dd4279646e.mp3","entryId":"73138","definition":"用手抓着往自己的方向拉。","pronunciation":["자바끌다"]}],"audio":"/audio/21e00df910c578256f83.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n73138-1-7-2","ko":"미안, 그러니까 말로 할 때 따라왔어야지.","zh":"对不起。可我好好跟你说的时候，你就该跟过来呀。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"미안,","meaning":"抱歉，愧疚，不好意思，过意不去","explanation":"미안：抱歉，愧疚，不好意思，过意不去","readings":[{"term":"미안","audio":"/audio/ba804e5e1f4598116ffc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56257","senseId":"1","lemma":"미안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"미안","audio":"/audio/ba804e5e1f4598116ffc.mp3"}},{"text":"그러니까","meaning":"因此，所以","explanation":"그러니까：因此，所以","readings":[{"term":"그러니까","audio":"/audio/f064d1058a27cd3851f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58609","senseId":"1","lemma":"그러니까","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그러니까","audio":"/audio/f064d1058a27cd3851f3.mp3"}},{"text":"말로","meaning":"话，语言","explanation":"말：话，语言；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"2","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말로","audio":"/audio/435b44d506bb612693c5.mp3"}},{"text":"할","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{